Current Dev Position: YP 2.6 M3. - This is feature freeze for YP 2.6!

Next Deadline: YP 2.6 M3 Build Target is Aug. 27, 2018


SWAT Team Rotation:

=B7         SWAT lead is currently: Tracy

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Tracy-> Armin on Sept. 21, 2018

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Armin -> Chen on Sept. 28, 2018

=B7         https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Build_Failure_Swat_Tea=
m


Key Status/Updates:

=B7         We=92re now well into M3 feature freeze so new feature patches,=
 particularly for unplanned changes will be deferred until 2.7.

=B7         M3 has still not been built yet however we have:

o    upgraded to openssl 1.1 final

o    merged the allarch multilib changes we were waiting for.

o    resolved the xserver upgrade issues and merged the fixes/upgrades

o    the python3 openssl issues were resolved, thanks Anuj!

=B7         The main remaining question is what, if anything to do with ope=
nssh for 2.6. Upstream have now reluctantly merged openssl 1.1 support. Any=
 new release date containing that work is unknown but its tempting to upgra=
de to the latest from revision control and then take the new released versi=
on into 2.6 when it does happen., thereby unifying openssl support in OE-Co=
re.

=B7         There is a bug that has been identified in relocating gnupg-nat=
ive causing oe-selftest failures.

=B7         An issue with the buildbot autobuilder UI plugin code was debug=
ged and a fix sent and accepted upstream.


Planned Releases for YP 2.6:

=B7         YP 2.6 M3 Build Target is Aug. 27, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M3 Release Target is Sept. 7, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Build Target is Oct. 1, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Release Target is Oct. 26, 2018


Planned upcoming dot releases:

=B7         YP 2.4.4 (Rocko) will be targeted after YP 2.6 M4 is done.

=B7         YP 2.5.2 (Sumo) will be targeted after YP 2.4.4 is done.


Tracking Metrics:

=B7         WDD 2589 (last week 2580) (https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/charts=
/combo.html)

=B7         Poky Patch Metrics

o    Total patches found: 1646 (last week 1646)

o    Percentage of patches in the Pending State: 736 (45%) [last week 736 (=
45%)]


